Join HTSP connection workers before destroying their demuxers.

CTvheadend::Stop only requested disconnection. Its destructor could delete
demuxers while the registration thread was still in Connected/SetProfile.
Joining the receive thread also joins its registration thread, while all
callback targets and the connection object are still alive.

Upstream: generic lifecycle fix worth sending to pvr.hts.

--- a/src/Tvheadend.cpp
+++ b/src/Tvheadend.cpp
@@ -74,6 +74,7 @@
     dmx->Close();
 
   m_conn->Stop();
+  m_conn->StopThread();
   StopThread();
 }
 
